// 2. ŵ ← LSQQuantFn(W, s, qmin, qmax, g_scale·(1+2/qmax))
//    (LSQ gradient on s, STE on W, but with a bit-amplified scale-grad)
// 3. forward weight = (1-α)·W + α·ŵ where α ramps 0→1 over [0, warmup_frac·T]
//    warmup_frac = 0.25 / 0.35 / 0.50 for 4 / 3 / 2 bits
// 4. aux_loss:
//    a) outlier hinge: $\beta\,\overline{\mathrm{ReLU}(|W/s| - q_{\max})}$, β anneals 0.05→0.01, ×3 at INT2
//    b) after warmup, in-grid attraction: $0.001\overline{(\mathrm{clip}(W/s) - \mathrm{round}(\cdot))^2}$ (×5 at INT2)

// 1. init s_g ← 2·mean|W_g|/sqrt(qmax)  (LSQ paper init)
// 2. ŵ ← LSQQuantFn(W, s, qmin, qmax, 1/sqrt(N·qmax))
// 3. noise_ratio_t ← min(1, (t+1)/warmup_steps)
